#. type: SS
#: archlinux
#, no-wrap
msgid "ARM, 32bit and other CPU types error out \\X'tty: link https://github.com/archlinux/archinstall/issues/1686'I<\\%#1686>\\X'tty: link', \\X'tty: link https://github.com/archlinux/archinstall/issues/2185'I<\\%#2185>\\X'tty: link'"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux
msgid ""
"This is a bit of a catch-all known issue.  Officially \\X'tty: link https://"
"wiki.archlinux.org/title/"
"Frequently_asked_questions#What_architectures_does_Arch_support?'I<\\"
"%x86_64>\\X'tty: link' is only supported by Arch Linux.  Hence little effort "
