#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux
msgid ""
"This means that feature requests like supporting filesystems such as "
"\\X'tty: link https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/zfs-linux'I<\\%ZFS>\\X'tty: "
"link' can not be added, and issues cannot be solved by using AUR packages "
